    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5b372c52-b4f3-5989-98b9-55594d3e2d04" activityNameId="3092de77-0e8f-5eca-aba5-a063f22154e4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium formate, reaction of formaldehyde with acetaldehyde, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium formate, reaction of formaldehyde with acetaldehyde, at plant
The multioutput-process "reaction of formaldehyde with acetaldehyde" delivers the co-products "penta-erythritol, at plant" and "sodium formate from the reaction of formaldehyde with acetaldehyde".Sodium formate can be used as a fuel or sold. Assuming the formate is sold, the massxprice relation between penta and formate is 9.6:1, which is the figure entered into the inventory output.;
Formula: C5H12O4; 
UUID: 5c555a22-4b43-32a4-b3c1-508218baccdf
cradle-to-gate, including all precursors, ancillary materials and transports
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: based on literature data and plant data in Europe 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature, survey 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c555a22-4b43-32a4-b3c1-508218baccdf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
